# toolchain/PIN
# =============
#
# The toolchain the library is built and proved with: a release of
# nirapod-labs/toolchain, pinned by commit. That repository pins the Jasmin
# compiler (a commit of the integration branch of nirapod-labs/jasmin),
# EasyCrypt, the SMT provers and the opam environment, and its build.sh
# checks each of them. This file names the release and records the Jasmin,
# EasyCrypt and coqword commits it builds, so that ci/jobs/toolchain.sh can
# compare them with the provenance record of the tools on PATH. Shell
# syntax, read by toolchain/build.sh and the CI; it only sets variables.

TOOLCHAIN_URL=https://github.com/nirapod-labs/toolchain.git
TOOLCHAIN_RELEASE=2026.11.1
TOOLCHAIN_COMMIT=9feb334af135253e5c15fb69c0e93af78a3c0f1b

# Recorded from the release's jasmin/PIN and easycrypt/PIN.
JASMIN_TAG=nirapod-2026.11.1
JASMIN_COMMIT=87a265eccd7ebd7b73f954bffa482715c6c771de
JASMIN_BASE=af6e17f9ad34463f6dd20fdb6dfa1a0852e768a7
EASYCRYPT_COMMIT=e7eff05dcef179fbd0b428e987632278e526b862
COQWORD_COMMIT=86ed49aeca65a8d32e81bb386778f49b45ee505b
